      "writtenOn": "2023-01-13T23:31:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In newer features we use a combination of system properties and flags\n\n* System properties are used to allow OEM to override behavior from AOSP code, like: https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/q/topic:%22le-audio-allow-list-mechanism%22\n* Flags allow remote config push to this particular Android platform\n\nNormally, we use the system property when flag is not available. However, when flag value is available, we use it to override at runtime. \n\nFor the initial CL, we can stick with system property.",
